# Path of the Bard (jeuno 20): Bki Tbujhja, Mataligeat and Mertaire in Lower Jeuno, the Song Runes of Valkurm Dunes.
# A Minstrel in Despair completed (never begun; no level or job check): Bki's 182, Mataligeat's 144, Mertaire's
# COULD_HE_BE (messageName(..., true, false): showName, no turn), a bone chip to Mertaire and the runes while offered
# (no trade handler: nil), the runes' 2 (the bard job unlocked,
# UNLOCK_BARD, completed: 3000 gil, the job gesture, Wandering Minstrel, fame +7 x3). Completed: Bki's 180,
# Mataligeat's 143, Mertaire's 103 while Painful Memory is available (a warrior: its section does not match).
lists LowerJeuno/Mertaire/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Mertaire/onTrade ValkurmDunes/Song_Runes/onTrade LowerJeuno/Bki_Tbujhja/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Mataligeat/onTrigger ValkurmDunes/Song_Runes/onTrigger ValkurmDunes/onEventFinish/2
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-19.5,0,-59 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.TheOldMonument completed
quest Jeuno.AMinstrelInDespair completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger Bki_Tbujhja                         # available: 182
finish
trigger Mataligeat                          # 144
finish
trigger Mertaire                            # COULD_HE_BE (showName, no turn)
trade Mertaire BoneChip x1                  # available: no trade handler, nil
warp -717.6,-7.6,101 ValkurmDunes
walk -719.5,-7,102
trade Song_Runes BoneChip x1                # available: no trade handler, nil
trigger Song_Runes                          # cutscene 2
finish                                      # BRD unlocked, UNLOCK_BARD; completed: 3000 gil, the gesture, Wandering Minstrel, fame +7 x3
trigger Song_Runes                          # completed: no section; SONG_RUNES_DEFAULT
warp -19.5,0,-59 LowerJeuno
trigger Bki_Tbujhja                         # completed: 180
finish
trigger Mataligeat                          # 143
finish
trigger Mertaire                            # Painful Memory available: 103
finish
